WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.950
Sponsored Operations and Trips.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:09.262
Fully-funded trips taken by Canadian Parliament Members have been mapped through empirical handoff memory.

00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:18.925
These instances correlate with shifts in foreign policy rhetoric, specialized military procurement alignments, and intelligence sharing exceptions.

00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:24.562
Affected nodes include Senate, House of Commons Committees, and External Affairs.
